{{!
    @template tool_lp/user_competency_summary_in_course

    A learner's competency in a course (admin/tool/lp/user_competency_in_course.php), overridden by Dimensions.

    Mirrors tool_lp/user_competency_summary_in_course of Moodle 5.3 (2026100500),
    admin/tool/lp/templates/user_competency_summary_in_course.mustache. Re-diff it against that file on every
    core upgrade. tool_lp/renderer renders it (the theme's tool_lp_renderer adds dimband to the first paint);
    report_competency/grading_popup renders it in the breakdown report's "User competency summary" dialogue, with
    displayuser; and tool_lp/user_competency_info re-renders it through core/templates from
    tool_lp_data_for_user_competency_summary_in_course after a rating and replaces the root element with the answer:
    everything below renders from core's context alone, except the two counts of the band, which the JavaScript
    counts again from the rows on every render and after every deletion.

    Kept from core, because tool_lp's modules read them: the root's data-region-id="<uniqid>" (the reloader's root,
    replaced whole), with core's data-region="user-competency-full-info", data-node="user-competency",
    data-competencyid and data-userid; data-region="competency-summary"; the rate button's id rate_<uniqid>, which
    tool_lp/grade_user_competency_inline binds, drawn under the same cangrade as core's; the JavaScript, statement for
    statement, with the callback's parameters capitalised, four lines wrapped and displayuser written
    by a section where core compared two string literals, which eslint refuses as a constant condition (core's copy
    has no example context, so the lint never read it), followed by the band's count; the partial tool_lp/competency_summary and core's comment area. From
    tool_lp/evidence_summary, which core includes once per piece of evidence: each row carries
    data-region="evidence" with data-id (tool_lp/evidence_delete reads the id off exactly one such ancestor and
    removes it), the trigger data-action="delete-evidence" drawn only where the exporter says candelete, and the
    registration of the two selectors; the rating is a span with the class badge (tool_lp's "competency grade"
    selector). Kept for Behat: a dt "Proficient" followed by a dd holding the proficiency's name ("Yes", "No") and a
    dt "Rating" followed by a dd holding the rating's name. Every context key keeps core's escaping: the plans' names
    stay triple-stashed as in core, everything else is double-stashed.

    Changed: the head says who (the learner's picture and name, which core's page header already shows the same
    viewer, without the identity fields) and what (the competency summary) first, with "Rate" as the page's one
    primary button; a band of four figures (the rating in this course, proficiency, the number of pieces of evidence
    of this course with the most recent one's date, the number of learning plans core lists) in the data report's
    look; the evidence of this course is a table in a bounded frame, newest first as core lists it (what happened,
    when, the rating, by whom, the note, core's delete action); the linked activities and the learning plans are two
    panels below. Core's "displayuser" branch (the user block, identity fields included, that the grading popup
    asks for) gives way to the head, which names the learner in both places, by picture and name alone.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * usercompetencysummary - competency (a competency_summary record), user (a user_summary record), cangrade,
      usercompetencycourse (grade, gradename, proficiency, proficiencyname), evidence (evidence records), commentarea
    * course - id
    * coursemodules - the course modules linked to the competency (url, iconurl, name)
    * plans - the learning plans containing the competency the viewer may read (id, name)
    * pluginbaseurl - the address of admin/tool/lp
    * dimband - first paint only: evidencecount and plancount

    Example context (json):
    {
        "usercompetencysummary": {
            "cangrade": true,
            "competency": {
                "competency": {
                    "id": 1,
                    "shortname": "Communicate clearly",
                    "idnumber": "COMM-1"
                },
                "framework": {
                    "shortname": "Professional skills"
                },
                "taxonomyterm": "Competency",
                "scaleid": 2
            },
            "user": {
                "id": 3,
                "fullname": "Lea Learner",
                "profileimageurlsmall": "https://example.com/pix/u/f2.png"
            },
            "usercompetencycourse": {
                "grade": 2,
                "gradename": "Competent",
                "proficiency": true,
                "proficiencyname": "Yes"
            },
            "evidence": [
                {
                    "id": 1,
                    "userdate": "Tuesday, 13 October 2026, 10:04",
                    "grade": 2,
                    "gradename": "Competent",
                    "description": "The competency was rated in the course Writing for the web.",
                    "note": "Clear structure in the final essay.",
                    "actionuser": {
                        "id": 2,
                        "fullname": "Tess Teacher",
                        "profileurl": "https://example.com/user/profile.php?id=2",
                        "profileimageurlsmall": "https://example.com/pix/u/f2.png"
                    },
                    "candelete": true
                },
                {
                    "id": 2,
                    "userdate": "Friday, 2 October 2026, 16:20",
                    "grade": null,
                    "gradename": "-",
                    "description": "The activity Essay was completed.",
                    "url": "https://example.com/mod/assign/view.php?id=7",
                    "candelete": true
                }
            ]
        },
        "course": {
            "id": 2
        },
        "coursemodules": [
            {
                "url": "https://example.com/mod/assign/view.php?id=7",
                "iconurl": "https://example.com/theme/image.php/dimensions/assign/1/monologo",
                "name": "Essay"
            }
        ],
        "plans": [
            {
                "id": 4,
                "name": "Writing plan"
            }
        ],
        "pluginbaseurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/lp",
        "dimband": {
            "evidencecount": 2,
            "plancount": 1
        }
    }
}}
{{#usercompetencysummary}}
<div data-region="user-competency-full-info" class="dim-comp-ucc" data-node="user-competency" data-competencyid="{{usercompetency.competencyid}}" data-userid="{{usercompetency.userid}}" data-region-id="{{uniqid}}">
<div data-region="competency-summary">
    <div class="dim-comp-ucc-head">
        <div class="dim-comp-ucc-what">
            {{#user}}
            <p class="dim-comp-ucc-who">
                <img class="dim-comp-ucc-who__avatar" height="24" width="24" src="{{profileimageurlsmall}}" alt="">
                <span>{{fullname}}</span>
            </p>
            {{/user}}
            {{#competency}}
                {{> tool_lp/competency_summary }}
            {{/competency}}
        </div>
        {{#cangrade}}
        <div class="dim-comp-ucc-primary">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" id="rate_{{uniqid}}">{{#str}}rate, tool_lp{{/str}}</button>
        </div>
        {{/cangrade}}
    </div>
    <section class="dim-comp-ucc-band" data-region="dim-comp-ucc-band" aria-label="{{#str}}competency_usercourse_band, theme_dimensions{{/str}}">
        <dl class="dim-comp-ucc-tiles">
            {{#usercompetencycourse}}
            <div class="dim-comp-ucc-tile">
                <dt class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__label">{{#str}}rating, tool_lp{{/str}}</dt>
                <dd class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__value">
                    {{#grade}}{{gradename}}{{/grade}}
                    {{^grade}}<span class="dim-comp-ucc-none">{{#str}}notrated, report_competency{{/str}}</span>{{/grade}}
                </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-comp-ucc-tile">
                <dt class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__label">{{#str}}proficient, tool_lp{{/str}}</dt>
                <dd class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__value">
                    {{#proficiency}}
                    <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--proficient">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        {{proficiencyname}}
                    </span>
                    {{/proficiency}}
                    {{^proficiency}}
                    {{#grade}}
                    <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notproficient">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        {{proficiencyname}}
                    </span>
                    {{/grade}}
                    {{^grade}}
                    <span class="dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--notrated">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-minus dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                        {{proficiencyname}}
                    </span>
                    {{/grade}}
                    {{/proficiency}}
                </dd>
            </div>
            {{/usercompetencycourse}}
            <div class="dim-comp-ucc-tile">
                <dt class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__label">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_evidence, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</dt>
                <dd class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__value" data-dim-figure="evidence">{{#dimband}}{{evidencecount}}{{/dimband}}</dd>
                <dd class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__sub" data-region="dim-comp-ucc-latest"{{^evidence.0}} hidden{{/evidence.0}}>{{#str}}competency_usercourse_latest, theme_dimensions{{/str}} <span data-dim-figure="latest">{{#evidence.0}}{{userdate}}{{/evidence.0}}</span></dd>
            </div>
            <div class="dim-comp-ucc-tile">
                <dt class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__label">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_plans, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</dt>
                <dd class="dim-comp-ucc-tile__value" data-dim-figure="plans">{{#dimband}}{{plancount}}{{/dimband}}</dd>
            </div>
        </dl>
    </section>
    {{#js}}
    require(['jquery', 'tool_lp/grade_user_competency_inline', 'tool_lp/user_competency_info', 'tool_lp/evidence_delete'],
            function($, Mod, Info, EvidenceDelete) {

        var competencyElement = $('[data-region-id="{{uniqid}}"]');

        var displayuser = {{#displayuser}}true{{/displayuser}}{{^displayuser}}false{{/displayuser}};
        var infoReloader = new Info(competencyElement, '{{competency.competency.id}}', '{{user.id}}', '', '{{course.id}}',
            displayuser);
        {{#cangrade}}
            var inlineGrader = new Mod('#rate_{{uniqid}}', '{{competency.scaleid}}', '{{competency.competency.id}}', '{{user.id}}',
                '', '{{course.id}}', '{{#str}}chooserating, tool_lp{{/str}}');
            inlineGrader.on('competencyupdated', infoReloader.reload.bind(infoReloader));
        {{/cangrade}}

        EvidenceDelete.register('[data-action="delete-evidence"]', '[data-region="evidence"]');

        // The band's two counts come from the rows this render drew: core's re-render brings no dimband, and
        // tool_lp/evidence_delete removes a row without re-rendering.
        var rows = competencyElement.find('[data-region="dim-comp-ucc-rows"]');
        var paint = function() {
            var evidence = rows.find('[data-region="evidence"]');
            var latest = evidence.first().find('[data-dim-cell="when"]').text().trim();
            competencyElement.find('[data-dim-figure="evidence"]').text(evidence.length);
            competencyElement.find('[data-dim-figure="plans"]').text(competencyElement.find('[data-dim-plan]').length);
            competencyElement.find('[data-dim-figure="latest"]').text(latest);
            competencyElement.find('[data-region="dim-comp-ucc-latest"]').prop('hidden', evidence.length === 0);
            competencyElement.find('[data-region="dim-comp-ucc-frame"]').prop('hidden', evidence.length === 0);
            competencyElement.find('[data-region="dim-comp-ucc-empty"]').prop('hidden', evidence.length > 0);
        };
        paint();
        if (rows.length && typeof window.MutationObserver === 'function') {
            new window.MutationObserver(paint).observe(rows.get(0), {childList: true});
        }
    });
    {{/js}}
    {{#commentarea}}
        {{#canpostorhascomments}}
            {{>tool_lp/comment_area}}
        {{/canpostorhascomments}}
    {{/commentarea}}
    <section class="dim-comp-ucc-section" data-region="evidence-listing" aria-labelledby="dim-comp-ucc-evidence-{{uniqid}}">
        <h4 class="dim-comp-ucc-title" id="dim-comp-ucc-evidence-{{uniqid}}">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_evidence, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</h4>
        <div class="dim-comp-ucc-gridframe" data-region="dim-comp-ucc-frame"{{^evidence.0}} hidden{{/evidence.0}}>
            <table class="dim-comp-ucc-grid">
                <caption class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_caption, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</caption>
                <colgroup>
                    <col class="dim-comp-ucc-col--what">
                    <col class="dim-comp-ucc-col--when">
                    <col class="dim-comp-ucc-col--rating">
                    <col class="dim-comp-ucc-col--by">
                    <col class="dim-comp-ucc-col--note">
                    {{#evidence.0.candelete}}<col class="dim-comp-ucc-col--actions">{{/evidence.0.candelete}}
                </colgroup>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_what, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_when, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}rating, tool_lp{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_by, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</th>
                        <th scope="col">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_note, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</th>
                        {{#evidence.0.candelete}}
                        <th scope="col"><span class="visually-hidden">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_actions, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</span></th>
                        {{/evidence.0.candelete}}
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody data-region="dim-comp-ucc-rows">
                    {{#evidence}}
                    <tr class="evidence" data-region="evidence" data-id="{{id}}">
                        <th scope="row">
                            <span class="dim-comp-ucc-cell__main">{{description}}</span>
                            {{#url}}<a class="dim-comp-ucc-cell__sub" href="{{url}}" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">{{url}}</a>{{/url}}
                        </th>
                        <td class="dim-comp-ucc-cell--when" data-dim-cell="when">{{userdate}}</td>
                        <td>
                            {{#grade}}
                            <span class="badge dim-comp-pill dim-comp-pill--rated">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-star dim-comp-pill__icon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                                {{gradename}}
                            </span>
                            {{/grade}}
                            {{^grade}}<span class="dim-comp-ucc-none">–</span>{{/grade}}
                        </td>
                        <td>
                            {{#actionuser}}{{> tool_lp/user_summary }}{{/actionuser}}
                            {{^actionuser}}<span class="dim-comp-ucc-none">–</span>{{/actionuser}}
                        </td>
                        <td class="dim-comp-ucc-cell--note">
                            {{#note}}{{note}}{{/note}}
                            {{^note}}<span class="dim-comp-ucc-none">–</span>{{/note}}
                        </td>
                        {{#candelete}}
                        <td class="dim-comp-ucc-cell--actions">
                            <a href="#" class="btn btn-link btn-sm" data-action="delete-evidence">{{#pix}}t/delete, core, {{#str}}delete{{/str}}{{/pix}}</a>
                        </td>
                        {{/candelete}}
                    </tr>
                    {{/evidence}}
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <p class="dim-comp-evidence-empty" data-region="dim-comp-ucc-empty"{{#evidence.0}} hidden{{/evidence.0}}>{{#str}}noevidence, tool_lp{{/str}}</p>
    </section>
    <div class="dim-comp-ucc-panels">
        <section class="dim-comp-ucc-panel" aria-labelledby="dim-comp-ucc-activities-{{uniqid}}">
            <h4 class="dim-comp-ucc-title" id="dim-comp-ucc-activities-{{uniqid}}">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_activities, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</h4>
            <ul class="dim-comp-ucc-list" data-region="coursecompetencyactivities">
            {{#coursemodules}}
                <li><a href="{{url}}"><img class="icon" src="{{iconurl}}" alt=""> {{name}}</a></li>
            {{/coursemodules}}
            {{^coursemodules}}
                <li class="dim-comp-ucc-none">{{#str}}noactivities, tool_lp{{/str}}</li>
            {{/coursemodules}}
            </ul>
        </section>
        <section class="dim-comp-ucc-panel" aria-labelledby="dim-comp-ucc-plans-{{uniqid}}">
            <h4 class="dim-comp-ucc-title" id="dim-comp-ucc-plans-{{uniqid}}">{{#str}}competency_usercourse_planslist, theme_dimensions{{/str}}</h4>
            <ul class="dim-comp-ucc-list">
            {{#plans}}
                <li data-dim-plan="{{id}}"><a href="{{pluginbaseurl}}/plan.php?id={{id}}">{{{name}}}</a></li>
            {{/plans}}
            {{^plans}}
                <li class="dim-comp-ucc-none">{{#str}}nouserplanswithcompetency, competency{{/str}}</li>
            {{/plans}}
            </ul>
        </section>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
{{/usercompetencysummary}}
